  "notes": "USAGE:\n{付与|ふよ}する is a formal verb meaning to grant or bestow something, typically used for abstract things like rights, authority, or rewards rather than physical objects.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ポイントを{付与|ふよ}する (to award points)\n- {権限|けんげん}を{付与|ふよ}する (to grant authority)\n- {資格|しかく}を{付与|ふよ}する (to confer a qualification)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n{与|あた}える is a more general word for giving, while {付与|ふよ} specifically implies formal bestowal by an organization or authority. {授与|じゅよ} is used for ceremonially presenting awards or diplomas.",
